# Keeps this stow package present in a fresh clone.
#
# The only other file here is `target`, runtime state written by the target-set and
# target-reset shell functions, and it is gitignored on purpose. Without this file the
# package arrives empty, and stow is all-or-nothing: one package with no files aborts the
# whole deployment, so none of the other seven get linked either. That is what left a
# freshly installed machine with an empty desktop.
